<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>The Great Wave off Kanagawa — Low-Poly 3D Wallpaper</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html, body {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #efe3c6;
